{
  "start": "-PT6H",
  "periodOverride": "inherit",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 24,
      "height": 3,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "# Graviton benchmark \u2014 G4 vs G5\n100k \u00b7 300k \u00b7 1m \u00b7 3m \u00b7 10m reads | us-east-2 | G4 above, G5 below. Queue-wide metrics include other runs and failed attempts. Counts are per plotted interval, not run totals.\n\n**G5 live queue-depth telemetry is connected** (2026-09-18 16:37 UTC): spot-short-g5, spot-metaphlan-g5 and spot-humann-g5 were added to the queue-depth Lambda QUEUE_ARNS alongside the four original queues; depth is polled every 60s. The G5 queues are currently DISABLED, so zeros are real zeros. Blank metrics still do not mean zero. Success/failure events use the existing all-queue publisher. Dashboard is standalone and editable in AWS."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 7,
      "properties": {
        "title": "G4 \u2014 tiny spot (spot-queue)",
        "metrics": [
          [
            "AWS/Batch",
            "SucceededJobCount",
            "JobQueue",
            "arn:aws:batch:us-east-2:730883236839:job-queue/spot-queue",
            {
              "color": "#2ca02c",
              "label": "Succeeded"
            }
          ],
          [
            "AWS/Batch",
            "FailedJobCount",
            "JobQueue",
            "arn:aws:batch:us-east-2:730883236839:job-queue/spot-queue",
            {
              "color": "#d62728",
              "label": "Failed"
            }
          ],
          [
            "AWS/Batch",
            "PendingJobCount",
            "JobQueue",
            "arn:aws:batch:us-east-2:730883236839:job-queue/spot-queue",
            {
              "color": "#ff7f0e",
              "label": "Pending",
              "stat": "Maximum"
            }
          ],
          [
            "AWS/Batch",
            "RunnableJobCount",
            "JobQueue",
            "arn:aws:batch:us-east-2:730883236839:job-queue/spot-queue",
            {
              "color": "#1f77b4",
              "label": "Runnable",
              "stat": "Maximum"
            }
          ],
          [
            "AWS/Batch",
            "StartingJobCount",
            "JobQueue",
            "arn:aws:batch:us-east-2:730883236839:job-queue/spot-queue",
            {
              "color": "#9467bd",
              "label": "Starting",
              "stat": "Maximum"
            }
          ],
          [
            "AWS/Batch",
            "RunningJobCount",
            "JobQueue",
            "arn:aws:batch:us-east-2:730883236839:job-queue/spot-queue",
            {
              "color": "#17becf",
              "label": "Running",
              "stat": "Maximum"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "period": 60,
        "stat": "Sum",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "region": "us-east-2"
      }
    },
